- All coordinates are relative to the player's spawn position (since all scene commands use `~` notation)
- The red stained glass cross center is at `~8, ~3, ~8` (spawn-relative)
- The cross spans from `~7,~2,~8` to `~9,~4,~8` (3 wide at y=3, plus one above and one below at x=8)

